# Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong: a spell with no legal target can't be cast (CR 601.2c), so with Swords to Plowshares on top
# and no creature on the battlefield the trigger looks at it and asks nothing (`! Bot1.Accept`). Bot1 puts the Planetarium
# out on turn 1 (Sol Ring, Black Lotus, Mox Jet), activates it with Mox Pearl and scries 2, keeping Swords to Plowshares
# on top. The scenarios with a castable card on top are asked. Swords stays on top.

